---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StickyCTA from "../../components/StickyCTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Data & Reports | Resources | Vision 8:28"
  description="Vision 8:28 acts as a Single Source Of Truth for timely, relevant, and actionable insights that inform strategy, policy, and investment across the economic development ecosystem."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white">
    <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-white py-32 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,')] opacity-20"></div>
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-4xl">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
              Data That Drives Better Decisions
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Vision 8:28 acts as a "Single Source Of Truth" for timely, relevant, and actionable insights that inform strategy, policy, and investment across the economic development ecosystem.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="#reports"
            class="inline-block bg-[#24a4b9] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#1d8a9d] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
          >
            View Data & Reports
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
            Why This Matters To You
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            In today's economy, intuition is not enough. Data-driven decisions must be grounded in evidence, trends, and real-world signals.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="reports" class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            What's Included
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            Comprehensive research and analysis to guide your economic development strategy
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                  Economic Indicators & Regional Analysis
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
                  → Understand growth, risk, and opportunity
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Access comprehensive regional economic data, trend analysis, and forecasting to identify emerging opportunities and understand market dynamics in real time.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                  Program Performance Reports
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
                  → Measure what's working—and why
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Transparent, outcomes-focused reports on program effectiveness, return on investment, and community impact to guide resource allocation and continuous improvement.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 12l3-3 3 3 4-4M8 21l4-4 4 4M3 4h18M4 4h16v12a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V4z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                  Growth Intelligence Brief
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
                  → Monthly insights at the intersection of policy, capital, and execution
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Stay informed with our monthly publication featuring curated insights, emerging trends, policy updates, and strategic opportunities for economic development professionals.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                  White Papers & Research
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
                  → Deep dives for leaders and funders
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  In-depth research and analysis on critical issues facing the region, providing evidence-based recommendations and frameworks for strategic decision-making.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Trust & Credibility
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-lg">
              Transparent Methodology
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Our research methods, data sources, and analytical approaches are clearly documented and available for review.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-lg">
              Practitioner-Informed Analysis
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Our insights are shaped by on-the-ground experience and validated by economic development professionals across the region.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-lg">
              Designed for Public & Private Stakeholders
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Our reports serve the needs of government agencies, private sector leaders, nonprofits, and community organizations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">
          Ready to Access the Data?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg mb-8">
          Get the insights you need to make informed decisions and drive regional economic growth.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-block bg-[#24a4b9] text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#1d8a9d] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
        >
          Access the Latest Insights
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <StickyCTA
      title="Access Growth Intelligence"
      description="Get actionable insights, data, and resources to accelerate regional economic development."
      ctaText="Access Growth Intelligence"
      ctaHref="/resources/guides-toolkits"
    />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
